# name: newrelic-service-and-networks-all
# priority: 0206
# section: development
# description: New Relic 域名、必要遥测与接收网络合集
# boundary: 覆盖0205域名范围及3290公网目的IPv4/IPv6，主动选用时优先于追踪拦截。不能等价表达no-resolve的客户端会标记本组不可用，可使用0205域名方案。与0205、3260、3290或包含这些成员的合集二选一；不加入公共探测器专属出站地址、旧网段或客户VPC。
# created-at: 2026-11-26T20:13:18Z
# updated-at: 2026-11-26T20:13:18Z
# rule-count: 31
# source: https://newrelic.com/
# source: https://docs.newrelic.com/docs/new-relic-solutions/get-started/networks/
# source: https://nr-downloads-main.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/networking/newrelic-ip-ranges.json
# source: https://docs.newrelic.com/docs/security/security-privacy/compliance/fedramp-compliant-endpoints/
# source: https://docs.newrelic.com/docs/data-apis/ingest-apis/security-data-api/

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,newrelic.com
DOMAIN,newrelic.github.io
DOMAIN,nr-synthetics-production-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com
DOMAIN,nr-synthetics-production-jp.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com
DOMAIN,nr-synthetics-production.s3.amazonaws.com
DOMAIN,onenr.io
DOMAIN,pa-api.newrelic-external.com
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.nr-assets.net
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.nr-ext.net
IP-CIDR,64.251.192.0/20,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,152.38.128.0/19,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,162.247.240.0/22,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,185.221.84.0/22,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,212.32.0.0/20,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2401:7c60::/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2602:816:5000::/40,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2620:16:4000::/48,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2a0d:8000::/29,no-resolve
DOMAIN,fonts.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,fonts.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,secure.gravatar.com
DOMAIN,www.google.com
DOMAIN,www.gstatic.com
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.nr-data.net
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.typescript.azureedge.net
DOMAIN,auth.docker.io
DOMAIN,production.cloudfront.docker.com
DOMAIN,registry-1.docker.io
DOMAIN,withpixie.ai
DOMAIN,work.withpixie.ai
